# Bench evidence is local by default: raw 4-channel PCM runs ~128 kB/s, so a
# 90 s capture is ~11 MB and the tree would bloat fast.
# EXCEPTION, deliberate: a capture that a COMMITTED document cites as its
# evidence gets force-added (`git add -f`), so a fresh clone can check the
# claim. Keep raw audio OUT.
captures/
